"kada svi korisnici imaju problem, dodajte:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:100
msgid "or, in database:"
msgstr ""

#: ../faq/index.rst:106
msgid ""
"Members who had enabled one keep it; they are simply no longer asked for a "
"code until a policy is set again."
msgstr ""
"Članovi koji su već uključili drugi faktor zadržavaju ga; kod im se samo "
"neće tražiti dok ponovno ne postavite pravilo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:110
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Keep an access to your database at hand before you enable a second factor "
