msgid ""
"Keep an access to the server hosting Galette -- its command line, or its "
"database -- at hand before you enable a second factor on the super "
"administrator account. It is the only way back in for it."
msgstr ""
"Prije uključivanja drugog faktora za račun glavnog administratora osigurajte "
"pristup bazi podataka. To je jedini način povratka pristupa tom računu."

#: ../faq/index.rst:114
msgid "How to report a bug or ask for a feature?"
msgstr "Kako prijaviti pogrešku ili zatražiti značajku?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:116
msgid ""
"Bugs reports as well as RFE (Request For Enhancement) must be done on the "
"`Galette tracker <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, for Galette "
"itself, all official plugins and also documentation."
msgstr ""
"Pogreške i zahtjevi za poboljšanje (RFE) prijavljuju se u `sustavu za "
"praćenje Galettea <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, za sam "
"Galette, sve službene dodatke i dokumentaciju."

#: ../faq/index.rst:120
msgid ""
"Unless you are sure you know, please do not attribute the ticket and do not "
"set target version. It will be done when it is taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste sigurni, nemojte dodjeljivati prijavu ni postavljati ciljnu "
"verziju. To će se odrediti pri obradi prijave."

#: ../faq/index.rst:122
msgid "If you have doubts, feel free to ask your questions on mailing lists ;)"
msgstr "Ako imate nedoumica, slobodno postavite pitanja na dopisnim listama ;)"

#: ../faq/index.rst:125
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Prijavi pogrešku"

#: ../faq/index.rst:127
msgid "Please, do not forget to:"
msgstr "Ne zaboravite:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:129
msgid "tell us the Galette version you are using,"
msgstr "navesti verziju Galettea koju koristite,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:130
msgid "be clear and concise,"
msgstr "biti jasni i sažeti,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:131
msgid "to provide all required information in order to reproduce the issue"
msgstr "navesti sve podatke potrebne za ponavljanje problema,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:132
msgid "to provide related logs entries."
msgstr "priložiti odgovarajuće zapise iz zapisnika."

#: ../faq/index.rst:135
msgid "Request For Enhancement"
msgstr "Zahtjev za poboljšanje"

#: ../faq/index.rst:137
msgid ""
"Make sure to be precise as well on RFEs. Developers may not guess what you "
"have in mind, you have to explain them, event if this seems obvious to "
"you ;) Requested enhancements are tagged as \"Souhaits\" (wishes, in "
"french), and moved by developers when work begins most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Budite precizni i pri zahtjevima za poboljšanje. Razvojni programeri ne mogu "
"pogoditi što zamišljate: objasnite im, čak i ako vam se čini očitim ;) "
"Zahtjevi dobivaju oznaku „Souhaits” (želje na francuskom), a programeri ih "
"obično premještaju kada započnu rad."

#: ../faq/index.rst:140
msgid ""
"Once you made your wishes, you can `submit it to a vote <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_, most wanted features may catch devs attention."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što opišete želju, možete je `predložiti za glasanje <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_. Značajke s najviše glasova mogu privući pažnju "
"razvojnih programera."

#: ../faq/index.rst:144
msgid "How to search in lists archives?"
msgstr "Kako pretraživati arhive dopisnih lista?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:146
msgid ""
"Mailing lists are the main communication channel for Galette, from its "
"beginnings."
msgstr ""
"Dopisne liste glavni su komunikacijski kanal Galettea od njegovih početaka."

#: ../faq/index.rst:148
msgid ""
"See `contact page <https://galette.eu/site/contact#mailing-lists>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Više informacija nalazi se na `stranici za kontakt <https://galette.eu/site/"
"contact#mailing-lists>`_."

#: ../faq/index.rst:150
msgid ""
"The most simple and reliable way to `search on past Galette related "
"discussion <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ is to "
"make a query on mail archive services."
msgstr ""
"Najjednostavniji i najpouzdaniji način za `pretraživanje ranijih rasprava o "
"Galetteu <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ jest "
"upit u uslugama koje arhiviraju dopisne liste."

#: ../faq/index.rst:154
msgid "How to use same email address for several members?"
msgstr "Kako koristiti istu adresu e-pošte za više članova?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:156
msgid "This is a very frequent question; many would love to do that..."
msgstr "Ovo je vrlo često pitanje; mnogi bi to željeli…"

#: ../faq/index.rst:158
msgid "**This is not possible.**"
msgstr "**To nije moguće.**"

#: ../faq/index.rst:160
msgid ""
"Indeed, mail addresses must be unique in the database. It is a choice for "
"the project on which several features are built:"
msgstr ""
"Adrese e-pošte u bazi podataka moraju biti jedinstvene. To je projektna "
"odluka na kojoj se temelji nekoliko značajki:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:162
msgid "lost password,"
msgstr "oporavak lozinke,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:163
msgid "login (since Galette 0.9)."
msgstr "prijava (od Galettea 0.9)."

#: ../faq/index.rst:165
msgid ""
"Making them non unique is not a solution we want to rely on. This would be "
"complicated, and should be source of many bugs."
msgstr ""
"Odustajanje od jedinstvenosti adresa nije rješenje koje želimo koristiti. To "
"bi bilo složeno i moglo uzrokovati mnogo pogrešaka."

#: ../faq/index.rst:167
msgid ""
"However, it is possible in Galette to :ref:`link several members "
"<linkmembers>`. That way, some information such as email and postal "
"addresses will be retrieved from the parent member if missing."
msgstr ""
"Ipak, Galette omogućuje :ref:`povezivanje više članova <linkmembers>`. Tada "
"se podaci poput adrese e-pošte i poštanske adrese preuzimaju od nadređenog "
"člana ako nedostaju."

#: ../faq/index.rst:169
msgid ""
"This allows finally to use a unique email address for several members in "
"database; but they are not duplicates in database."
msgstr ""
"Tako se ista adresa e-pošte može koristiti za više članova, ali se u bazi "
"podataka ne pojavljuje kao duplicirani zapis."

#: ../faq/index.rst:175
msgid "I forgot my password, what now?"
msgstr "Zaboravio/la sam lozinku, što sada?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:177
msgid ""
"On the login page, click on **Lost your password?**, type your username or "
"your email address, and follow the link of the email you receive. The link "
"works once, and for 24 hours. See :ref:`forgotten or new password "
"<my_account_password>`."
msgstr ""
"Na stranici za prijavu kliknite **Zaboravili ste lozinku?**, unesite "
"korisničko ime ili adresu e-pošte i slijedite poveznicu u primljenoj poruci. "
"Poveznica vrijedi jednom, tijekom 24 sata. Pogledajte :ref:`zaboravljena ili "
"nova lozinka <my_account_password>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:179
msgid ""
"No email? Check your spam folder. If your member card has no email address, "
"ask a staff member of your association to fix it, or to change your password "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Nema poruke? Provjerite neželjenu poštu. Ako u vašem članskom kartonu nema "
"adrese e-pošte, zamolite člana uprave da je doda ili da vam promijeni "
"lozinku."

#: ../faq/index.rst:181
msgid ""
"The **super administrator** is not a member and cannot use this form. Its "
"password can be changed :ref:`from the command line "
"<cli_superadmin_password>`, by the person who manages the server."
msgstr ""
"**Glavni administrator** nije član i ne može koristiti taj obrazac. Osoba "
"koja upravlja poslužiteljem može mu promijeniti lozinku :ref:`iz naredbenog "
"retka <cli_superadmin_password>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:187
msgid "A member cannot log in anymore"
msgstr "Član se više ne može prijaviti"

#: ../faq/index.rst:189
msgid "Check, in this order:"
msgstr "Provjerite ovim redom:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Is the account active?** An inactive account cannot log in. Open the "
"member card, and check the **Account** field in the **Galette-related data** "
"part."
msgstr ""
"**Je li račun aktivan?** Neaktivan račun ne može se prijaviti. Otvorite "
"članski karton i provjerite polje **Račun** u odjeljku **Podaci vezani uz "
"Galette**."

#: ../faq/index.rst:192
msgid ""
"**Has the member been blocked after too many failures?** After several wrong "
"passwords in a row, Galette refuses further attempts for 15 minutes, even "
"with the right password. Go to **Configuration**, then **Authentication "
"attempts**: the account is listed there if it is blocked, and **Lift** "
"unblocks it at once. See :ref:`authentication attempts <auth_attempts>`."
msgstr ""
"**Je li član blokiran nakon previše neuspjelih pokušaja?** Nakon nekoliko "
"uzastopnih pogrešnih lozinki Galette odbija daljnje pokušaje 15 minuta, čak "
"i s ispravnom lozinkom. Otvorite **Konfiguracija**, zatim **Pokušaji "
"prijave**: blokirani račun bit će na popisu, a **Ukloni blokadu** odmah ga "
"odblokira. Pogledajte :ref:`pokušaji prijave <auth_attempts>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Is the password right?** If in doubt, the member can ask for a new one "
"with **Lost your password?** on the login page."
msgstr ""
"**Je li lozinka ispravna?** Ako niste sigurni, član može zatražiti novu "
"putem **Zaboravili ste lozinku?** na stranici za prijavu."

#: ../faq/index.rst:194
msgid ""
"**Does the member use two-factor authentication?** See :ref:`my two-factor "
"authentication codes are refused <faq_2fa>`."
msgstr ""
"**Koristi li član dvofaktorsku autentifikaciju?** Pogledajte :ref:`moji "
"kodovi za dvofaktorsku autentifikaciju se odbijaju <faq_2fa>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:200
msgid "Emails sent by Galette never arrive"
msgstr "Poruke koje Galette šalje nikad ne stižu"

#: ../faq/index.rst:202
msgid "Go to **Configuration**, then **Settings**, **E-Mail** tab:"
msgstr ""
"Otvorite **Konfiguracija**, zatim **Konfiguracija**, karticu **E-pošta**:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:204
msgid ""
"check that an **Emailing method** is selected, and that the **Sender Email** "
"is an address of your association,"
msgstr ""
"provjerite je li odabran **Način slanja e-pošte** i je li **E-pošta "
"pošiljatelja** adresa vaše udruge,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:205
msgid ""
"click on **Test connection**, then on **Send a test email**, to your own "
"address; see :ref:`testing the settings <mail_tests>`."
msgstr ""
"kliknite **Provjeri vezu**, zatim **Pošalji probnu poruku** na vlastitu "
"adresu; pogledajte :ref:`provjera postavki <mail_tests>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:207
msgid ""
"If the test email does not arrive either, check your spam folder, then ask "
"your web host or your mail provider which settings to use: many of them "
"require sending through their SMTP server, with a username and a password."
msgstr ""
"Ako ni probna poruka ne stigne, provjerite neželjenu poštu pa pitajte "
"pružatelja mrežnog smještaja ili e-pošte koje postavke treba koristiti. "
"Mnogi zahtijevaju slanje putem svojeg SMTP poslužitelja, uz korisničko ime i "
"lozinku."

#: ../faq/index.rst:209
msgid ""
"If the test email arrives but mailings do not, your mail provider may limit "
"how many messages you can send per hour or per day; see :ref:`sending limits "
"<mail_throttling>`."
msgstr ""
"Ako probna poruka stigne, a skupne poruke ne, pružatelj e-pošte možda "
"ograničava broj poruka po satu ili danu. Pogledajte :ref:`ograničenja slanja "
"<mail_throttling>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:215
msgid "How do I renew a membership?"
msgstr "Kako obnoviti članstvo?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:217
msgid ""
"Simply record the new membership fee: go to **Contributions**, then **Add a "
"membership fee**, select the member, the contribution type and the amount. "
"Galette calculates the new end of membership on its own, from the end of the "
"previous one; no day is lost if the member renews early. "
"See :ref:`management rules <man_generalites>`."
msgstr ""
"Samo evidentirajte novu članarinu: otvorite **Uplate**, zatim **Dodaj "
"članarinu**, odaberite člana, vrstu uplate i iznos. Galette sam izračunava "
